Chapter: FrameShortBuffer
  cites Net chapter MessageFraming
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 We say:

Section: Fixtures

 whole is the positive control: a length prefix of 4 with its four bytes
 present. A decoder that answered empty to everything would pass every arm
 below without it.

  whole : List Integer = [4, 0, 0, 0, 65, 66, 67, 68]

 Each of these is a length the peer chose that the buffer does not honour.
 short is the one that used to die, reading index 4 of a 4-element list.

  short : List Integer = [4, 0, 0, 0]
  huge : List Integer = [255, 255, 255, 255]
  runt : List Integer = [7]
  empty-bs : List Integer = []

 THE PAIR THE REFUSAL CHANNEL EXISTS FOR. declared-empty says zero bytes and
 they are present; short says four and they are not. Both decode to nothing, so
 the value cannot tell them apart and only `valid` can. If these two ever read
 the same, the channel has stopped carrying anything.

  declared-empty : List Integer = [0, 0, 0, 0]

Section: Entry
  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let w = frame-decode-text whole 0
    in act
      print-line-uni ("whole-len=" & show (text-length (w.value)))
      print-line-uni ("whole-next=" & show (w.next-offset))
      print-line-uni ("short-len=" & show (text-length ((frame-decode-text short 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("huge-len=" & show (text-length ((frame-decode-text huge 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("runt-len=" & show (text-length ((frame-decode-text runt 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("empty-len=" & show (text-length ((frame-decode-text empty-bs 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("whole-bytes=" & show (list-length ((frame-decode-bytes whole 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("short-bytes=" & show (list-length ((frame-decode-bytes short 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("huge-bytes=" & show (list-length ((frame-decode-bytes huge 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("tag-of-runt=" & show (frame-decode-tag runt))
      print-line-uni ("len-of-runt=" & show (frame-decode-length runt))
      print-line-uni ("body-of-short=" & show (list-length (frame-decode-body short)))
      print-line-uni ("whole-valid=" & show (w.valid))
      print-line-uni ("declared-empty-len=" & show (text-length ((frame-decode-text declared-empty 0).value)))
      print-line-uni ("declared-empty-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-text declared-empty 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("short-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-text short 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("huge-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-text huge 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("runt-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-text runt 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("empty-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-text empty-bs 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("bytes-whole-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-bytes whole 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("bytes-short-valid=" & show ((frame-decode-bytes short 0).valid))
      print-line-uni ("survived")
    end
  end
